# Authentication for the "Edit trip" / "Plan this trip" Claude calls. Use ONE of these.
#
# A) API key (simplest). If set, it is always used.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
#
# B) Workload identity federation (no long-lived secret): the server proves it is your Vercel
#    deployment with Vercel's OIDC token, and Anthropic swaps that for a short-lived access token.
#    Leave ANTHROPIC_API_KEY empty. Set these four in Vercel (values come from the Anthropic Console):
# ANTHROPIC_FEDERATION_RULE_ID=fdrl_...
# ANTHROPIC_ORGANIZATION_ID=...
# ANTHROPIC_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_ID=svac_...
# ANTHROPIC_WORKSPACE_ID=            # only if the rule covers more than one workspace
# To supply your own identity token instead of Vercel's, set ANTHROPIC_IDENTITY_TOKEN_FILE (or _TOKEN).
# Optional: override the model (defaults to claude-sonnet-5-5).
# CLAUDE_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5-5
# Optional: map tiles. Defaults to the public OpenStreetMap tile server (fine for light use).
# For real traffic use a tile provider and set its URL template and attribution.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_MAP_TILES=https://tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png
# NEXT_PUBLIC_MAP_ATTRIBUTION=© OpenStreetMap contributors
